     "name": "Can a non-resident get an EIN without an ITIN?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "A non-resident can get an EIN without an ITIN. On Form SS-4 a foreign individual with no SSN or ITIN can still apply. Because the online system usually expects a US number, many foreign owners apply by fax or post instead."
