    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "When does an LLC owner need an ITIN?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "An LLC owner needs an ITIN when they personally must file a US return, such as Form 1040-NR for effectively connected income or a K-1 from a multi-member LLC, want to claim a US refund, or when a bank, payer or partnership requires a personal US TIN."
     }
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "Is an EIN the same as an ITIN?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "An EIN is not the same as an ITIN. An EIN is issued to a business on Form SS-4. An ITIN is issued to an individual on Form W-7. Many UK founders need only the EIN, at least at the start."
