    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "How much does it cost to get an EIN from the UK?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "An EIN costs nothing from the IRS directly. If you want help, ITIN Pro UK charges £375 all-inclusive, with no VAT, to prepare and file the EIN application. An ITIN, if you later need one, is a separate £450 service."
