      "text": "An ITIN is needed if you receive a K-1 as a foreign partner, including as an investor in a US LLC taxed as a partnership. The partnership must identify you, and tax withheld on your share and reported on Form 8805 is credited on your Form 1040-NR, which needs an ITIN, so you can reclaim any excess."
